  distributed with this product.

Models and content
  Each row of 13-ark-node/catalog/catalog.csv names its licence, whether that
  licence has been verified against the upstream terms (license_status), and
  whether the item may be redistributed (redistribute). Some items may not be
  redistributed, or only non-commercially. Read those columns before you build
  a node for someone else, and the upstream terms before you rely on them.

